/**
 * Shared behaviour for records that carry a monetary exposure figure.
 *
 * Data rule §4.3.4 requires every exposure to be attributable to a named
 * gate, market or supplier — never a free-floating amount. Types that mix
 * {@link HasExposure} therefore carry both the figure and the cause that
 * makes it defensible in front of a Notified Body auditor.
 */
type HasExposure {
  /** Revenue exposed by this record, in euros. */
  exposure: double

  /**
   * The named cause the exposure is attributable to — a gate code, a market
   * code or a supplier name. Satisfies model invariant §4.3.4.
   */
  exposureCause: string
}
